{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065358/block/singleImage/3276067/df/01M85NJGC7MRX5ZCTFCCVH6Z5P.jpeg?updatedAt=1795487188\"/><figcaption>跨部門東九龍反黑工，搜多個罪案黑點拘11男女。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>東九龍總區包括機動部隊、黃大仙警區、秀茂坪警區、觀塘警區及將軍澳警區人員聯同相關部門，昨日 (23 日 ) 展開反非法勞工聯合行動，突擊搜查東九龍總區多個罪案黑點，共拘捕 11 人。 行動中，人員共拘捕 8 名內地男子、兩名內地女子及一名本地女子，年齡介乎 29 至 57 歲，涉嫌「違反逗留條件」、「協助及教唆他人違反逗留條件」、「使用他人身份證」及「盜竊」。所有被捕人現正被扣留調查。</p><figure><img src=\"https://cdn3.am730.com.hk/processed/2026-11/1065358/block/singleImage/3276078/df/01M85NKF1MWH7NNMC3NCTZHYKE.jpeg?updatedAt=1795487188\"/><figcaption>跨部門東九龍反黑工，搜多個罪案黑點拘11男女。(警方圖片)</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.679231+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":254,"images":2,"source":"am730","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:20:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T23:57:34.907929+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T03:37:19.568043+00:00","content_hash":"02137466ad51316fa81105ec82837cbcf147a767b6c18b1cd3f561396615d47b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T03:43:56.679231+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}